# NOTE (corrected): .env files ARE intentionally ignored — Emergent's platform automation
# (emergent-agent-e1) actively re-enforces this and reverted an earlier attempt to commit
# real secret values here (also blocked by GitHub push secret-scanning). Do NOT try to commit
# backend/.env or frontend/.env again — the deploy pipeline's MANAGE_SECRETS step injects
# secrets at deploy time through a separate mechanism, not via git.
